  "readmeFile": "ReadMe.md",
  "releaseNotes": "### 6.2.391\nFix: RaceCondition in instantiating AdsSession objects thread parallel, #251298\n### 6.2.387\nFix: 'An item with the same key has already been added' ArgumentException on reentrant access to TwinCAT.TypeSystem.SymbolicAnyTypeMarshaler.CanMarshalByReflection()\n### 6.2.379\nFix: Prevent AmsSend/AmsSendAsync deadlock during TwinCAT Restart/Reconfig\n### 6.2.351\nFix: Adds missing override handler AdsSessionBase.OnConnectAsync (Session.ConnectAsync leads to System.AggregateException), #240184\"\n### 6.2.345\nFix: RpcMethodCollection.Empty always returns the same static instance. Changing the collection had side effects on all instances.\n### 6.2.341\nEnh: Additional checks for TcpFrame validity. Logging out the Last valid frames on invalid frame is received.\nEnh: Recovering from invalid TcpFrames (closing TcpSocket on invalid frame, reestablish on next Ams Request).\n### 6.2.317\nFix: Potential NullReferenceException Response Receiver (AmsServerNet.OnReceiveAmsCommands)\n### 6.2.315\nFix: First communication after Router Restart fails, RouterStateChange.Started not fired #235701\n### 6.2.311\nFix: Map Request TargetAddresses in AmsHeader from AmsNetId.Loopback to AmsNetId.Local preventing AmsNetId.Loopback sent over the network.\nEnh: Enhanced logging in the AdsClient/AdsServer ReceiverLoop\n### 6.2.305\nFix: Write access to dynamic struct values and dynamic array values throws ArgumentOutOfRangeException, #204478\n### 6.2.301\nFix: Cannot connect AdsClient running under MacOS, #232770, GitHub #67\n### 6.2.293\nFix: TypeCastException in EnumType.GetValues()\n### 6.2.287\nFix: System.Exception: AmsServer 'AdsOverMqtt' is not set! Error message if client fails to connect to router, #232197\n\t(GitHub: https://github.com/Beckhoff/TF6000_ADS_DOTNET_V5_Samples/issues/65)\n### 6.2.281\nAdsClient is not recovering from local Router Restart/Reconfig, #230951\n### 6.2.278\nEnh: Fallback usage of 'TcAmsServer.dll' internally enables function on systems that don't have TCP Loopback port open (e.g TC2 and systems with TCP Loopback disabled), #230847\n### 6.2.257\nFix: Some Subsymbols of TC2 system FB not available in SymbolLoader, #22463\n### 6.2\nEnh: Implementation of AdsOverMqtt channel (by usage of Beckhoff.TwinCAT.AdsOverMqtt package)\nEnh: Support of Unix File Sockets instead of Loopback TCP\nEnh: Support of .NET configuration providers in AdsClient/AdsServer/AdsRouter (Package Beckhoff.TwinCAT.Ads.ConfigurationProviders)\nEnh: Implementation of specific ADS/Ams logging providers (Package Beckhoff.TwinCAT.Ads.ConfigurationProviders)\nEnh: TargetFramework dependencies changed to net8.0, net6.0, netstandard2.0\nBreakingChange: Replacing ILogger parameter in constructors (AdsSession,AdsClient,AdsServer,AmsTcpIpRouter) by ILoggerFactory to enable more flexible category based logging.",
